        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: \"Live While We're Young\", \"Take Me Home\"\n- Organizations: One Direction\n- People: Niall Horan, Liam Payne, Harry Styles, Louis Tomlinson, Zayn Malik\n- Places: London\n\nFacts:\n- One Direction are an English-Irish pop boy band based in London.\n- One Direction are composed of Niall Horan, Liam Payne, Harry Styles, Louis Tomlinson, and formerly Zayn Malik.\n- \"Live While We're Young\" is a song by One Direction.\n- \"Take Me Home\" is One Direction's second studio album, released in 2012.\n- \"Live While We're Young\" was released as the lead single from One Direction's 2012 album \"Take Me Home\".\n- Zayn Malik left One Direction on 25 March 2015.",
